Booking Agent - Enhanced Time Slot Selection Module (Premium UX)
================================================================
Advanced time slot selection interface with zero ambiguity design.

This module provides:
- Visual grid layout (not scrolling list)
- Day period grouping (Morning, Afternoon, Evening)
- Letter identifiers (A-Z) for non-ambiguous selection
- Multiple input formats (letters, 24h, 12h with am/pm)
- Color coding by activity level (available, busy, recommended)
- Smart suggestions (preferred times based on customer tier)
- Real-time validation (immediate feedback on selection)
- Mobile-friendly layout (responsive grid)
- Accessibility (keyboard navigation, screen reader support)

Based on:
- Google Material Design principles
- UX best practices for time selection
- Human factors research (reducing cognitive load)
- Accessibility guidelines (WCAG 2.1)

