🎯 SLOT INFORMATION DETAILS - WHAT EACH BOX CONTAINS
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Each time slot box shows 4 pieces of information:

```
    ┌──────┐
    │  A   │  ← LETTER (Primary identifier - never ambiguous)
    │ 09:00│  ← HOUR 24h (Can be used for selection)
    │ 9am  │  ← HOUR 12h (Can be used for selection)
    │ ✅ 2 │  ← AVAILABILITY STATUS + COUNT
    └──────┘
```

Layout Details:
- Line 1: Letter (A-Z) - Primary non-ambiguous identifier
- Line 2: Time in 24h format (HH:MM)
- Line 3: Time in 12h format (h:MM am/pm)
- Line 4: Status + availability count

Status Indicators:
- ✅ Available (show count: ✅ 2 means 2 spots left)
- ⚠️ Limited (⚠️ 1 means only 1 spot left)
- ❌ Full (slot is full, not selectable)
- ✨ Recommended (special indicator for tier-suggested time)


═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
🕒 GROUPING LOGIC - BY TIME OF DAY
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Organize slots by time period (cognitive chunking = easier scanning):

MORNING (🌅):      08:00 - 11:59
AFTERNOON (☀️):    12:00 - 16:59
EVENING (🌙):      17:00 - 20:59

Benefits:
✅ Users scan visually by period (not random list)
✅ Natural thinking pattern (morning person, afternoon, etc.)
✅ Respects business psychology (energy levels peak different times)
✅ Reduces cognitive load (grouped = easier memory)


═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
🎨 COLOR & SYMBOL CODING
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Color Coding (for visual differentiation):

🟢 GREEN BACKGROUND (or ✅ emoji):
   - Full availability (many spots open)
   - User's tier preferred time (if applicable)
   - Normal selection

🟡 YELLOW BACKGROUND (or ⚠️ emoji):
   - Limited availability (1-2 spots left)
   - Getting full soon
   - Still selectable but shows scarcity

🔴 RED BACKGROUND (or ❌ emoji):
   - Full (no availability)
   - Not selectable
   - Grayed out or dimmed

⭐ STAR ICON (✨ or ⭐):
   - Recommended for this customer (based on tier/history)
   - Personalization signal
   - First suggestion to try


Symbols Used:
🌅 = Morning (8am - noon)
☀️ = Afternoon (noon - 5pm)
🌙 = Evening (5pm - 8pm)
✅ = Available with indicator
⚠️ = Limited availability
❌ = Full/Unavailable
✨ = Recommended/Special
📌 = Pinned/Suggested option


