🎯 INPUT VALIDATION - ZERO AMBIGUITY
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

RULE 1: Single Letter (A-Z)
INPUT: "A", "B", "C", ..., "Z"
✅ ACCEPT: Direct match to slot letter
FEEDBACK: "✅ Perfecto, elegiste las 09:00 (9am). ¿Confirmar?"

RULE 2: Hour 24h Format (HH:MM)
INPUT: "09:00", "13:30", "17:00"
✅ ACCEPT: Find matching slot by time
FEEDBACK: "✅ Perfecto, elegiste las 09:00 (9am). ¿Confirmar?"

RULE 3: Hour 24h Number (13-23)
INPUT: "13", "17", "18" (numbers > 12 always 24h)
✅ ACCEPT: Convert to HH:00 and find slot
FEEDBACK: "✅ Perfecto, elegiste las 13:00 (1pm). ¿Confirmar?"

RULE 4: Hour 12h with am/pm
INPUT: "9am", "1:30pm", "5pm" (any format with am/pm)
✅ ACCEPT: Parse and find matching slot
FEEDBACK: "✅ Perfecto, elegiste las 09:00 (9am). ¿Confirmar?"

RULE 5: Ambiguous Number (1-12 without am/pm)
INPUT: "5", "10", "2" (number without context)
❌ REJECT: Ambiguous (could be am/pm/letter)
FEEDBACK: "⚠️ Necesito confirmar:
          A) Opción C (09:00)
          B) 5am (05:00)
          C) 5pm (17:00)?
          Responde A, B, o C"

RULE 6: Invalid Input
INPUT: "xyz", "mañana", "no sé"
❌ REJECT: Not recognized format
FEEDBACK: "No entendí. Por favor elige:
          • Letra: A, B, C...
          • Hora: 09:00, 9am, 17:00
          [Mostrar opciones nuevamente]"


═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
✨ TIER-BASED RECOMMENDATIONS
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

TIER 1 (New Customer):
- No recommendation (no history)
- Show all options equally
- Neutral: "Elige el horario que mejor te venga"

TIER 2 (Recurring Customer):
- Suggest preferred time (if clear pattern)
- Highlight: "📌 Tu horario favorito: Opción C (10:00)"
- Pre-select option (visual highlight, not auto-select)

TIER 3 (Power Customer):
- Strong recommendation with confidence
- Highlight + bold: "✨ RECOMENDADO: Opción C (10:00) - 92% match"
- Maybe offer one-click: "[✅ Aceptar] [Cambiar]"


