⌨️ KEYBOARD NAVIGATION (Accessibility)
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Users can navigate entirely by keyboard:

↑ ↓ ← → = Navigate between slots
ENTER = Select highlighted slot
TAB = Move to next section
SHIFT+TAB = Move to previous section
ESC = Go back / Cancel

Benefits:
✅ Accessible for motor disability users
✅ Power users can navigate faster
✅ Screen reader compatible


