═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
🎓 ERROR PREVENTION BEST PRACTICES
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

1. CLEAR INSTRUCTIONS
   - Separate instructions from choices
   - Use numbered list, not prose
   - Provide examples for each method

2. NO AMBIGUOUS INPUTS
   - Letters are never ambiguous (A-Z are distinct)
   - 24h times never ambiguous (09:00 is exact)
   - Require am/pm for 12h format

3. CONFIRMATION GATE
   - Always confirm BEFORE committing
   - Show selected time clearly
   - "¿Confirmar las 09:00?" (not just "¿Confirmar?")

4. VISUAL HIERARCHY
   - Primary action is obvious (large, contrast)
   - Secondary actions are visible but less prominent
   - Instructions are clear (not hidden)

5. SMART DEFAULTS
   - If customer has preferred time, highlight it
   - If slot is getting full, show warning
   - If time is peak hours, show availability

6. UNDO CAPABILITY
   - Can go back and change without losing data
   - Can restart if needed
   - No accidental commits


